WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.900
At this rate, Nora will undergo torsional collapse within 6 hours!

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.570
But I'll be taking the Diva into my own hands.

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.200
I'm not your enemy!{we had this as "an enemy" last time, but your sounds better}

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.950
Here we go!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:15.820
Why, you!

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:20.830
These ones are different...

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.300
It is the space age, hundreds of years after people began to emigrate to space colonies.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.090
The wars that were once fought for control of the Earth Sphere had ended,{this comma wasn't there last time, but it seems like a comma splice without it}

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:35.300
and it seemed that an era of peace had arrived.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.760
However, this fleeting peace collapsed.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:46.980
A colony was destroyed by an unidentified enemy that suddenly appeared.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:52.990
The curtain was rising on a new battle that would continue over 100 years. {End of repeated lines}

