00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.920
Episode 3 
The Twisted Colony

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.880
The moving objects believed to be mobile suits are still approaching.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.380
T-They're fast!

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:37.550
At this rate, they'll make contact in thirty seconds.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:41.680
Prepare the anti-aircraft guns. {oh lol}

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:46.270
Fire!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:01.780
Don't let it get away!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.570
It's too late. We've lost visual.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.580
What are they trying to do?

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.790
What are they after?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:24.220
It's trying to keep me from using the DODS Rifle?

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.400
If I could just hit it, it would only take one shot!{this is one sentence I think  If I could just hit it, it would only take one shot!}

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:52.620
There's still plenty of time!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.040
Please remain calm and follow the evacuation instructions! {and follow personall instructions for removal/evactuation}

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.550
Tow cables 1 through 150 have been connected.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.720
Engine room, begin final tuning of engine output.

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.720
What's the status on the control cables?

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:11.640
We can't start moving the core unless they're perfect!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.690
Less than forty minutes left until Nora collapses!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:15.350
I didn't expect to see you as captain of the Diva.

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.400
It was Central Command's decision.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:22.400
I see... So are the UE still attacking?

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.700
The Gundam is fighting them as we speak.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:25.870
Flit...

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.660
Flit has already destroyed two of them.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.120
We're going to believe in him and continue the operation.

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.210
That's right.

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:34.920
We'll have to trust him with this. {we have to let him do that for us}{it's instead of that's?}

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:40.340
We have less than thirty minutes left to evacuate all the residents.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:43.470
I suppose there's a fifty-fifty chance we can pull it off.

00:04:43.470 --> 00:04:45.680
There's no point in thinking about probabilities!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.640
We just have to do it.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:50.560
Right...

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.850
Take care of everyone.

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:54.270
Yes, sir.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.690
Continue to keep a close eye on the surrounding area!

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:02.280
All crew are to continue their duties and be ready for battle at any moment!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:02.900
Yes, sir!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:06.070
They found two more enemies?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.910
Aren't there any more Genoaces on board the Diva?

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:11.160
None that are ready for combat...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.750
So we have to rely on the Gundam?

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.710
Crap!

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.420
Flit!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:24.670
Hit him already!

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:25.840
Flit!

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.760
Yurin! I can't see!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.140
Stay calm.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.180
You should know what you have to do to win.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.020
You should know.

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.080
I see... He's following a pattern too!

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:52.990
I've got it!

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:56.500
Now!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:05:59.540
Right there!

00:06:14.390 --> 00:06:17.100
The Gundam has taken out the enemy mobile suit-type!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.310
Flit pulled it off!

00:06:18.310 --> 00:06:19.400
Yes!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.110
He's amazing!

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:23.230
Stay focused. We're in the middle of an operation.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.650
How much longer until Nora falls apart?

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:26.530
Thirty-two minutes.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:28.900
Send the Gundam after the remaining—

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:30.450
What's going on?

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.240
Unit spotted inside Nora.{sightings of aircraft inside}

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.330
It's the one we just saw!

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:35.240
Inside the colony?

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:46.670
That thing's insane!

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:50.340
It went inside a colony that's falling apart?

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:51.510
That's bad.

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.430
If it goes after the colony core from inside...

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.310
Send the Gundam.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:57.100
Flit, you can hear me, right?

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.390
A mobile suit-type UE has infiltrated Nora.{has entered/infiltrated/penetrated Nora}{blush}

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.270
Pursue it.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.020
Inside Nora?

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:05.270
We haven't finished evacuating the residents.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.320
No way...

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.990
Will I be able to take down another one? {can i take it down?}

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.370
Flit, calm down.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.740
I know, but...

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:22.420
<i>The Gundam has entered Nora.</i>

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.250
<i>Flit, the enemy unit moves quickly.</i>

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:25.960
<i>Be careful.</i>

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:26.880
<i>Roger.</i>

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:28.420
Flit...

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.470
Let's send the Gundam a stronger weapon!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.800
The AGE Builder can make one fast, right?

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.640
It's not that simple!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:39.350
Without data, we won't know what kind of weapon would work.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.560
But...

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:45.360
And what's more, no matter how powerful a weapon is,

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:47.440
it's a person that has to use it.

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.070
What matters in the end is that person's wisdom and courage.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.360
Wisdom and courage?

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:53.490
Yes.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:56.080
Let's believe in Flit.

00:07:56.080 --> 00:07:59.450
He and the Gundam can do it.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:14.300
The operation is proceeding from Phase 5 to Phase 6.

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.720
Now then, it's time to move on to the final stage.{the final stage}

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.060
A mobile suit-type!?

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:38.700
We've lost contact with Arinston Base!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:40.790
It appears to be under attack.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.790
They went for the base, and not the core?!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.960
Did they know that you can only separate the core from within the base?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.210
That's impossible!

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:49.460
What about Commander Bruzar?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:52.970
Whereabouts unknown.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:12.650
I'm not letting you get away with this! {wont let you keep doing as you like}

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:22.910
It's fast.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:28.500
Twenty minutes until Nora completely collapses. {complete collapse, really}

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.750
Can you tell what's going on in the base yet?

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.300
Still nothing.

00:09:32.300 --> 00:09:36.300
All Nora residents have been evacuated to the colony core.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.720
The connection between Diva and the core is 82% complete.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:45.560
Even if we finish the connection, if we can't separate it from the rest of the colony,

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.520
we can't escape!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.190
The commander's direct line?

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.610
Captain Grodek, it's me.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:58.160
Commander Bruzar!

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:02.080
The base has been destroyed.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.540
But don't give up.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:08.000
We haven't run out of options. {there's still cards to play, a hand to play}

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.170
Continue the operation.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:16.170
Let's show those aliens we still have some fight left in us! {lts show them our will, our spirit}

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:30.520
It's too fast!

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:36.110
Where'd it go?

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:36.780
Up?{this line is really fast but it's there}{ue}

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.000
Now where is it?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.040
Flit, above us.

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:55.920
It's all right.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.880
It won't be coming back for a while.

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.930
Yurin, are you...?

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:03.930
Here.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:05.760
The old construction management center.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.600
It was supposed to have been sealed when the colony was completed.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.850
I didn't know it was still there.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:15.110
You're telling me we can separate the core there, Commander?

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.440
Yes.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:20.110
I kept it functional just in case.

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.700
I guess that was a good idea.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:26.540
But if it's destroyed, then we're really out of options.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.250
Commander Bruzar!

00:11:29.830 --> 00:11:32.170
I'm... fine.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.250
I made it.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:39.050
You take care of the mobile suit-type.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:39.920
Roger.

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:41.760
Where's the Gundam?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.090
What's going on with Flit?

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.260
He's engaging the enemy near Block 84 outside Nora.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.680
Don't let the enemy see what we're up to!

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.430
He just needs to keep it busy.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.150
Eleven minutes until Nora completely collapses.{complete collapse}

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.480
We're almost there.

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.900
We're counting on you, Gundam.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:01.490
So it's been seven years since then...

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.410
Flit...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.330
Flit Asuno, right?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:15.170
Yes.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.670
Good.{grunt, an acknowledgement}

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:21.840
Flit, I'm not taking you in out of pity.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:28.350
I'm interested in the Asuno family's talent as mobile suit craftsmen.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.930
Listen to me.

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:35.440
You need to live for the sake of your mother and father as well.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.070
Live, and carry on the blood of the Asuno family.

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:43.070
A savior?

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:43.860
That's right!

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:48.990
The Gundam I make is going to be a warrior who fights the evil that threatens mankind!{do we need a comma here}

00:12:48.990 --> 00:12:51.910
So it's going to be the savior that protects humanity!

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:57.380
A mobile suit that's a savior, huh?

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.130
You're pretty funny.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.550
Gundam, was it?

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.680
I've got high hopes, Flit.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:06.890
Yes, sir! {yes, yes sir!}

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:16.270
Flit, there's a reason you were spared.{was "left alive"}

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.580
Now the lower left.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.250
It hit!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.000
It's going to approach us.

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:42.630
Flit!

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.840
I know! To the right.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:52.510
I can do this!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:40.940
Main shafts 1 and 2 have been disconnected.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.650
Eight minutes until colony collapse!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.980
Checking control cable connections!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:49.150
The colony's core plasma propulsion engines are ready for high density ignition!

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.290
Disconnection of all shafts confirmed!

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:01.830
Good.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:05.250
Ignite the plasma propulsion engines at high density!

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.800
Diva, proceed at towing speed!{more like Diva, proceed at towing speed!}

00:15:13.800 --> 00:15:15.140
Maintain the core's attitude!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:46.130
They're pulling out the core!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.090
They made it in time!

00:15:47.090 --> 00:15:48.340
Flit!

00:15:49.970 --> 00:15:50.670
Oh no!

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:57.760
Stop it!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.980
I've only got one shot left in the rifle...

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:02.980
Flit!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:19.700
I won't let you go any further.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:24.710
I won't let you hurt Nora's citizens any more!

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.640
It retreated?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:41.810
Why?

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:49.150
Nora's...

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.780
Less than three minutes until Nora completely collapses.{<3 minutes}

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.080
So we made it just in time...

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:16.550
What?

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:18.140
There's a blockage inside the colony!

00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:22.430
One of the disconnected shafts fell on top of the core and is preventing it from proceeding!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.560
Can't we shake it off?

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.430
We can't!

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.980
If we pull too hard we'll lose attitude control.

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.650
We're so close...

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:35.780
The core...

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:36.700
Flit?

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.070
Something's wrong.

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:38.990
What happened?

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.500
Less than 120 seconds until Nora collapses.

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.050
What?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.010
What's wrong?

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:56.340
There's still a heat source moving inside the colony!

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:57.510
What?

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:11.110
Flit.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:14.780
Can you hear me, Flit Asuno?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:16.950
Mr. Bruzar!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.160
You've done well.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.370
The operation was a success.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:25.620
The Gundam you made is just as impressive as I thought.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.580
Mr. Bruzar, where are you?

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:28.750
I'll come get you...

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.090
No, you need to return to the Diva right away.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.800
There's no reason for you to be caught in the collapse.

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:35.840
But...

00:18:35.840 --> 00:18:37.420
I can't abandon you!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:41.350
You should be saving the lives of many, rather than just one!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:47.560
Now that you have power, you have the responsibilities that come with it.{spiderman anyone?}{hell yea}{if you can make this less awkward do so.}

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:48.640
Power...

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:50.190
The Gundam.

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:53.820
The power of the savior that will protect humanity.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.030
Mr. Bruzar...

00:18:57.440 --> 00:19:00.700
Become a savior, Flit.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.370
With the Gundam...

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.540
Mr. Bruzar!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:16.960
The blockage has been removed!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:17.710
Diva!

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:18.880
Full combat speed!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:46.680
We were able to contact the EFF Command Center.

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:51.480
A fleet should arrive in about ten hours to rescue the colony core.

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:52.520
Good.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:55.400
Hurry up and move the last civilians aboard the ship.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:58.570
We have another mission ahead of us.

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.900
<i>In two hours, the Diva will be heading to Fardain.</i>

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:10.160
<i>Because the ship is in mid-operation, all non-combatants are asked to move quickly to the colony core.</i>

